Upstream-Name: duscope
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/kawadeomkar/duscope/issues
Source: https://github.com/kawadeomkar/duscope
Comment: The binary is statically linked. It includes the Rust crates listed in
 DEPENDENCIES.md, under the licences deny.toml allows (MIT, MIT-0, Apache-2.0,
 BSD-3-Clause, ISC, Unicode-3.0, Unicode-DFS-2016, Zlib), musl libc (MIT),
 the mimalloc allocator (MIT, Copyright 2018-2025 Microsoft Corporation and
 Daan Leijen), which the libmimalloc-sys crate compiles into the musl builds,
 and a subset of the Inter font (OFL-1.1), below.

Files: *
Copyright: 2026 Omkar Kawade
License: MIT or Apache-2.0

Files: crates/duscope-walk/src/scheduler.rs
Copyright: 2019 Sebastian Thiel
           2026 Omkar Kawade
License: MIT
Comment: The worker pool of dua-core 5.0.1, from Byron/dua-cli at commit
 467f3ec158a8bdc3fd4f79d7d885841beacf6ea3 (VENDOR.md).

Files: crates/duscope-treemap/src/packs.rs
Copyright: 2021 Catppuccin
           2018-present Enkia
           2021 Folke Lemaitre
           2023 Dracula Theme
           2018 Pavel Pertsev
           2019 Jonas D.
           2026 Omkar Kawade
License: MIT and Apache-2.0
Comment: The colour values of the five built-in packs, from these colour
 schemes on GitHub: Catppuccin Mocha, the default (catppuccin/catppuccin,
 MIT); Tokyo Night (enkia/tokyo-night-vscode-theme, MIT, and four values,
 #3b4261, #565f89, #737aa2 and #ff007c, from its Neovim port
 folke/tokyonight.nvim, Apache-2.0); Dracula (dracula/dracula-theme, MIT);
 Gruvbox Dark (morhetz/gruvbox, MIT); and the light pack's base, text and
 accent colours from terminal.css (Gioni06/terminal.css, MIT).

Files: crates/duscope-treemap/src/font/Inter-Regular-subset.ttf
Copyright: 2016 The Inter Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter)
License: OFL-1.1
Comment: A subset of Inter 4.1 Regular, compiled into the binary for the
 labels of render's PNG: the glyphs of ASCII, Latin-1 and a little
 punctuation, cut by scripts/subset_font.py from rsms/inter at commit
 e3a3d4c57d5ecc01453a575621882a384c1995a3 (VENDOR.md). The licence text is
 also in crates/duscope-treemap/src/font/OFL.txt.

